  designNotes: 'Encore (the user, 2026-10-17): target enemy creature repeats today''s
    action for the next 2 Days: the same attack on the same slot, the same move or
    ability, and nothing else. Its plan is made for it at Dawn, so everyone sees
    it coming. Did nothing today: it does nothing for 2 Days.'
  artDescription: A man in a hotel bed slapping an alarm clock that reads 6:00, the
    same clock, the same bed, the same groundhog in a tiny top hat on the windowsill,
    three identical frames of it stacked like a film strip, his face more desperate
    in each.
  defaultTargetType: 4
